                    <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt; line-height: 1.15;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">The mission of California State Parks is to provide for the health, inspiration and education of the people of California by helping to preserve the state&#39;s extraordinary biological diversity, protecting its most valued natural and cultural resources, and creating opportunities for high-quality outdoor recreation.</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt; line-height: 1.15;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt; line-height: 1.15;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">All employees are responsible for contributing to an inclusive, safe, and secure work environment that values diverse cultures, perspectives, and experiences, and is free from discrimination. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>&nbsp;
                
