    <div id="pnlCustomSection2" class="jcBand">
	
        <h3 class="postingHeader">
            <span id="lblCustomSection2Header">Eligibility Information</span></h3>
        <p class="postingContent">
            <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">To be appointed you must satisfy one of the following requirements:</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="1" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">List Eligibility</span> – Successfully complete the civil service exam for Communications Operator. <span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">NOTE:</span> Please refer to the exam bulletin for the frequency of administration of this exam.&nbsp;To be eligible for this position, you must additionally apply to the Communications Operator Exam found here:&nbsp;<a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcalcareers.ca.gov%2FCalHrPublic%2FExams%2FExamBulletin.aspx%3FExamControlId%3D3574&amp;data=05%7C02%7CApril.Nurse%40parks.ca.gov%7C036e56702e904bafd76f08dd4d2a1809%7C06fd3d24656448018226b407c4d26b68%7C0%7C0%7C638751565378426596%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=qm0ztV8iuUW7qP1HhRHa4jd0aei4T4eS%2BxgxA45J4oU%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 11pt; text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration-line: underline;">CalCareers</span></a></li></ol>
