			<li style="margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">Transfer Eligibility</span> – Must have current employment with the State of California in the same classification or in a classification that is comparable. If in a different classification, you must meet the minimum qualifications (see Minimum Qualifications section and associated links above).</li></ol>
